// DRAW PANEL PRO MODULE
// Event handlers are dispatched by TradingDashboard.mq5; do not start a second timer.
//+------------------------------------------------------------------+
//|                                                  DrawPanelPro.mq5 |
//|  v0.60 - TradingView-style drawing toolbar for MetaTrader 5       |
